# OpenCode observability — captured LLM prompt/response data.
# These contain full prompt and response text and MUST NOT be committed.
var/opencode-observability/

# Agent worktrees created by the Workflow harness. Nested repositories: `git add -A` stages one
# as a 160000 gitlink pointing at a commit that exists only in this clone. bin/auto-sync refuses
# on that property regardless, but a refusal is a stopped sync plus a Discord alert every 15
# minutes — ignoring the path we KNOW about keeps the guard for the ones we do not.
.claude/worktrees/
